# Decisions

One file per decision, numbered in the order they were made: `NNNN-short-title.md`.

A record says what was decided, why, and what was turned down. Write one when a choice would
surprise the next person to read the code, and when a code comment used to carry that reason.
Comments are banned in this repo (see `0001-no-code-comments.md`), so this folder is where a
"why" lives when a test, a type or a name cannot state it.

Records that came out of code comments sit in `from-code/`, one file per area. They are
terse: a symbol and the reason behind it.
